{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>This offering.</b> This one brings incense as a free-will offering, and an individual does not bring incense as a free-will offering. This one brings a sin-offering not for a sin, and an individual does not bring a sin-offering except for a sin. This one pushes aside the Sabbath and impurity, and no single individual pushes aside the Sabbath and impurity."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:16:53.142778287Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}